# Stylesheet

Follow the CSS section of `docs/patterns.md`.

- Prefix every class with `better-gnome-shell-`.
- Keep a shell class in a selector only to narrow an extension class.
- Put shared look in `stylesheet.css`. Use inline `style` only for a value computed at runtime.
- Do not edit the shell theme under `/usr/share/gnome-shell`.

```css
/* Bad */
.panel {
    background-color: transparent;
}

/* Good */
.panel-button.better-gnome-shell-clock {
    padding: 0 4px;
}
```
